seg-e8ee3794bac6 = <b>MODELLED.</b> Under the stated assumptions (the constellation, its signal-in-space error, the station's survey accuracy, the correction latency and the link quantization, each an input labelled with its public source or as ILLUSTRATIVE), the model gives the figures below. They are <b>not</b> a statement about the performance of any real system. Kshana is <b>not</b> affiliated with or endorsed by any agency, and makes no TRL or heritage claim. Advisory only.

